bulkDiscountTest let thousand Int64 1000 immutable
bulkDiscountTest let nineHundred Int64 900 immutable
bulkDiscountTest let fifteen Int64 15 immutable
bulkDiscountTest let thirteen Int64 13 immutable
bulkDiscountTest at begin do discountRound
bulkDiscountTest at begin do expectRound
bulkDiscountTest at begin do discountOdd
bulkDiscountTest at begin do expectRoundedDown
bulkDiscountTest at begin return ok none

discountRound is call
discountRound in bulkDiscountTest
discountRound invokes bulkDiscount
discountRound argument cents Int64 thousand copy
discountRound result roundResult Int64
discountRound ownedBy none
discountRound cleanedBy none
discountRound borrows none
discountRound catch none

expectRound is call
expectRound in bulkDiscountTest
expectRound invokes test.assertEqualInt64
expectRound argument expected Int64 nineHundred copy
expectRound argument actual Int64 roundResult copy
expectRound result none
expectRound ownedBy none
expectRound cleanedBy none
expectRound borrows none
expectRound catch none

discountOdd is call
discountOdd in bulkDiscountTest
discountOdd invokes bulkDiscount
discountOdd argument cents Int64 fifteen copy
discountOdd result oddResult Int64
discountOdd ownedBy none
discountOdd cleanedBy none
discountOdd borrows none
discountOdd catch none

expectRoundedDown is call
expectRoundedDown in bulkDiscountTest
expectRoundedDown invokes test.assertEqualInt64
expectRoundedDown argument expected Int64 thirteen copy
