lineTotalTest is test
lineTotalTest purpose "Four at 250 cents under bulkDiscount is 900 cents"
lineTotalTest verifies lineTotal ruleOfGross
lineTotalTest typeParameter none
lineTotalTest input none
lineTotalTest output none
lineTotalTest outputOwnedBy none
lineTotalTest raises none
lineTotalTest effect none
lineTotalTest uses none
lineTotalTest memoryHeap false
lineTotalTest async false
lineTotalTest maxRecursion none
lineTotalTest label begin loopKind none
lineTotalTest label begin within none
lineTotalTest label priced loopKind none
lineTotalTest label priced within none
lineTotalTest label refused loopKind none
lineTotalTest label refused within none
lineTotalTest let sku Int64 7 immutable
lineTotalTest let four Int64 4 immutable
lineTotalTest let unit Int64 250 immutable
lineTotalTest let nineHundred Int64 900 immutable
lineTotalTest let rule PriceRule bulkDiscount immutable
lineTotalTest let refusedText String "a valid line was refused" immutable
lineTotalTest at begin do makeLine
lineTotalTest at begin do priceLine
lineTotalTest at begin branch ifError priceLine goto refused else goto priced
lineTotalTest at priced do expectCharge
lineTotalTest at priced return ok none
lineTotalTest at refused do failRefused
lineTotalTest at refused return ok none

makeLine is call
makeLine in lineTotalTest
makeLine invokes LineItem.new
makeLine argument sku Int64 sku copy
makeLine argument quantity Int64 four copy
makeLine argument unitCents Int64 unit copy
makeLine result line LineItem
makeLine ownedBy none
makeLine cleanedBy none
makeLine borrows none
makeLine catch none

priceLine is call
priceLine in lineTotalTest
priceLine invokes lineTotal
priceLine argument item LineItem line copy
priceLine argument rule PriceRule rule copy
priceLine result charged Int64
priceLine ownedBy none
priceLine cleanedBy none
priceLine borrows none
priceLine catch priceError PricingError

expectCharge is call
expectCharge in lineTotalTest
expectCharge invokes test.assertEqualInt64
