failRefused catch none

negativeLineTest is test
negativeLineTest purpose "A line of -1 of sku 7 is refused with negativeQuantity carrying 7"
negativeLineTest verifies lineTotal rejectsNegative
negativeLineTest typeParameter none
negativeLineTest input none
negativeLineTest output none
negativeLineTest outputOwnedBy none
negativeLineTest raises none
negativeLineTest effect none
negativeLineTest uses none
negativeLineTest memoryHeap false
negativeLineTest async false
negativeLineTest maxRecursion none
negativeLineTest label begin loopKind none
negativeLineTest label begin within none
negativeLineTest label inspect loopKind none
negativeLineTest label inspect within none
negativeLineTest label rightSku loopKind none
negativeLineTest label rightSku within none
negativeLineTest label wrongVariant loopKind none
negativeLineTest label wrongVariant within none
negativeLineTest label accepted loopKind none
negativeLineTest label accepted within none
negativeLineTest let sku Int64 7 immutable
negativeLineTest let minusOne Int64 -1 immutable
negativeLineTest let unit Int64 250 immutable
negativeLineTest let rule PriceRule fullPrice immutable
negativeLineTest let acceptedText String "a negative quantity was priced" immutable
negativeLineTest let wrongText String "a negative quantity gave the wrong error" immutable
negativeLineTest at begin do makeLine
negativeLineTest at begin do priceLine
negativeLineTest at begin branch ifError priceLine goto inspect else goto accepted
negativeLineTest at inspect match priceError PricingError
negativeLineTest at inspect case PricingError.negativeQuantity bind refusedSku Int64 goto rightSku
negativeLineTest at inspect case PricingError.emptyOrder bind none none goto wrongVariant
negativeLineTest at rightSku do expectSku
negativeLineTest at rightSku return ok none
negativeLineTest at wrongVariant do failWrong
negativeLineTest at wrongVariant return ok none
negativeLineTest at accepted do failAccepted
negativeLineTest at accepted return ok none

makeLine is call
makeLine in negativeLineTest
makeLine invokes LineItem.new
makeLine argument sku Int64 sku copy
makeLine argument quantity Int64 minusOne copy
makeLine argument unitCents Int64 unit copy
makeLine result line LineItem
makeLine ownedBy none
makeLine cleanedBy none
makeLine borrows none
makeLine catch none

priceLine is call
priceLine in negativeLineTest
priceLine invokes lineTotal
priceLine argument item LineItem line copy
priceLine argument rule PriceRule rule copy
priceLine result charged Int64
priceLine ownedBy none
priceLine cleanedBy none
priceLine borrows none
priceLine catch priceError PricingError

