orderTotalTest is test
orderTotalTest purpose "Two lines, 2 at 300 and 1 at 50, total 650 at list price, by either route"
orderTotalTest verifies orderTotal sumOfLines
orderTotalTest verifies listTotal atListPrice
orderTotalTest typeParameter none
orderTotalTest input none
orderTotalTest output none
orderTotalTest outputOwnedBy none
orderTotalTest raises none
orderTotalTest effect none
orderTotalTest uses none
orderTotalTest memoryHeap true
orderTotalTest async false
orderTotalTest maxRecursion none
orderTotalTest label begin loopKind none
orderTotalTest label begin within none
orderTotalTest label priced loopKind none
orderTotalTest label priced within none
orderTotalTest label listed loopKind none
orderTotalTest label listed within none
orderTotalTest label refused loopKind none
orderTotalTest label refused within none
orderTotalTest let one Int64 1 immutable
orderTotalTest let two Int64 2 immutable
orderTotalTest let threeHundred Int64 300 immutable
orderTotalTest let fifty Int64 50 immutable
orderTotalTest let sixHundredFifty Int64 650 immutable
orderTotalTest let rule PriceRule fullPrice immutable
orderTotalTest let refusedText String "a two-line order was refused" immutable
orderTotalTest at begin do makeLines
orderTotalTest at begin do makeFirst
orderTotalTest at begin do appendFirst
orderTotalTest at begin do makeSecond
orderTotalTest at begin do appendSecond
orderTotalTest at begin do priceOrder
orderTotalTest at begin branch ifError priceOrder goto refused else goto priced
orderTotalTest at priced do expectTotal
orderTotalTest at priced do priceList
orderTotalTest at priced branch ifError priceList goto refused else goto listed
orderTotalTest at listed do expectListTotal
orderTotalTest at listed return ok none
orderTotalTest at refused do failRefused
orderTotalTest at refused return ok none

store is region
store in orderTotalTest
store strategy arena
store maxBytes 4096
store released atReturn

makeLines is call
makeLines in orderTotalTest
makeLines invokes Lines.new
makeLines argument region Region store lend
makeLines result lines Lines
makeLines ownedBy store
makeLines cleanedBy none
makeLines borrows none
makeLines catch none

