emptyOrderTest is test
emptyOrderTest purpose "An order with no lines is refused with emptyOrder"
emptyOrderTest verifies orderTotal rejectsEmpty
emptyOrderTest typeParameter none
emptyOrderTest input none
emptyOrderTest output none
emptyOrderTest outputOwnedBy none
emptyOrderTest raises none
emptyOrderTest effect none
emptyOrderTest uses none
emptyOrderTest memoryHeap true
emptyOrderTest async false
emptyOrderTest maxRecursion none
emptyOrderTest label begin loopKind none
